## The challenge

Abu Dhabi Global Market’s digital presence spanned five separate properties (`adgm.com`, `adgmacademy.com`, `alreemisland.ae`, and `disputeresolution.adgm.com`) with over 5,000 pages. Migrating everything onto Optimizely DXP under a fixed-price statement of work required coordinating 25+ distributed specialists without disrupting live operations.

## What we did

- **Standardized Azure DevOps workflows.** Trained 20 team members on structured backlog tracking, sprint reporting, and release handoffs.
- **Enforced vendor and client SLAs.** Weekly SLA reviews cut delivery risks by 30%, reduced recurring issues by 25%, and shortened delivery cycles by 30%.
- **Protected commercial baselines.** Managed timesheets and change boundaries cleanly, enabling a smooth transition from Fixed-Price SOW to an ongoing SLA-governed maintenance contract.

## What shipped

All five websites launched smoothly onto Optimizely DXP, establishing a single, secure CMS foundation and a multi-year maintenance partnership.
